        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Assessed nominal yield (kusadaka): 27,281.9369 koku. The page prints the plain forms 八十一 where the project dataset records the formal 八拾壹; that difference does not change the number. The dataset's parsed figure of 27,281.93669 is wrong: 九斗三升六合九勺 is .9 + .03 + .006 + .0009 = .9369, and the dataset's own raw string agrees with the page, so only its parsed number is at fault."
